customer: hat_guy
computer: shows
brief:
	Special event. Newly infected. He only wants to show off: he insists that the player connects it, "I removed some unnecessary parts." Opened, it has no parts and runs anyway, on Cambion. Then he takes it with him and leaves.
	No problem file: NO PARTS (no issues, all parts missing, works anyway; the repair is to open the computer and close it again) is corruption, which CompuFunDB doesn't handle.
